            <ArticleTitle>An approach to the management of chronic pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1493-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Chronic pain can often be managed without the use of drugs. A psychotherapeutic approach using hypnosis is outlined. Understanding and relieving the suffering component allow a more effective control of pain by hypnosis, and make a return to normal possible.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
